[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13444.75, "timestamp": "03:44:04", "text": "所以，嗯，所以，所以，所以，呃，是音频吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13447.79, "timestamp": "03:44:07", "text": "好的，请告诉我音频是否正常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13451.229, "timestamp": "03:44:11", "text": "好的，你听到任何延迟或音频吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13455.63, "timestamp": "03:44:15", "text": "如果有类似的事情，请告诉我，好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13460.99, "timestamp": "03:44:20", "text": "哦等等，呃，我应该把……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13463.55, "timestamp": "03:44:23", "text": "音乐，嘿，你们有吗？你们会怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.75, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "更喜欢有音乐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13467.63, "timestamp": "03:44:27", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13471.71, "timestamp": "03:44:31", "text": "嗯……等等，完全没声音，等等，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13473.11, "timestamp": "03:44:33", "text": "你的意思是“不”吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13475.63, "timestamp": "03:44:35", "text": "声音 等等 等等 等等 等等 等等 等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13480.07, "timestamp": "03:44:40", "text": "等等，等等，你在开玩笑吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13483.389, "timestamp": "03:44:43", "text": "不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13491.59, "timestamp": "03:44:51", "text": "再次 n"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13493.87, "timestamp": "03:44:53", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13495.51, "timestamp": "03:44:55", "text": "不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13497.349, "timestamp": "03:44:57", "text": "为什么"}]